@startuml prediction
!theme plain
title Prediction Protocol

participant Orchestrator
participant "Node" as Node

== Prediction Request ==
Orchestrator -> Node: POST /predict\nContent-Type: application/json\n{\n  "id": "discharge_001",\n  "signals": {\n    "filename": "DES_0001_01_r1.txt",\n    "values": [1.2, 1.5, 1.8, 2.0, ...]\n  },\n  "times": [0.001, 0.002, 0.003, 0.004, ...],\n  "length": 1000\n}

alt Node can perform prediction
    note right of Node
      Node processes the discharge
      and runs the prediction model
      synchronously, then replies
    end note

    Node --> Orchestrator: 200 OK\n{\n  "prediction": "Anomaly",\n  "confidence": 0.93,\n  "executionTimeMs": 420.5,\n  "model": "svm",\n  "windowSize": 128,\n  "windows": [\n    {\n      "featureValues": [0.21, -1.35, 0.72],\n      "prediction": "Normal",\n      "justification": -0.45\n    },\n    {\n      "featureValues": [1.85, 0.12, -0.33],\n      "prediction": "Anomaly",\n      "justification": 1.23\n    }\n  ]\n}

else Node cannot perform prediction
    Node --> Orchestrator: 503 Service Unavailable
end

@enduml